     "y": 126,
     "w": 300,
     "h": 83
    },
    {
     "id": "max2",
     "role": "human",
     "text": "Hold the run\n\u2022 stops a step over its cap\n\u2022 accepts or rejects each difference\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u25e6 by reconciling-item category",
