     "role": "decide",
     "text": "Check and freeze\n\u2022 probe rights and caps, fail closed\n\u2022 hash-freeze the card\n\u2022 find tables by privilege ladder\n\u2022 grain and freshness tests\n\u2022 pin plan with batch marker",
